flowchart TD
    Opening[Normal empty rear / FarmlandSession] --> Initial[BattlefieldStart: existing start-blue-vehicle-02 / Military T01]
    Initial --> Policy[Current permitted CARRIER rows / original order]
    Policy --> Keyed[Supplied ID only: canonical spec / owner and controller / Military / PLACE / live / finite]
    Keyed --> Field[Scene-owned field T01 cache / one detailed body per actual ID]
    Keyed -->|ineligible| Abstract[Existing abstract CARRIER fallback]
    Art[Cleared T01Presentation factory / unchanged art and query boxes] --> Field
    Ground[Canonical XZ and heading / current terrain Y] --> Field
    Move[entity_moved / keyed parent dependents] --> Ground
    Facing[Proposed narrow vehicle_facing_changed / actual setter] --> Ground
    State[Current session state / damage event] --> Keyed
    Rear[Actual Rear presenter / Rear Strategic Delivery stays Rear] --> Handoff[Only actual Fleet Transfer HQ receipt changes domain and controller]
    Handoff --> Release[Release rear detailed body before field admission / same ID]
    Release --> Field
    Field --> Anchors[Cached actual ground anchors and condition]
    Anchors --> Cues[Fixed truck rectangle / hollow near40 / same18px pick]
    Camera[Existing pan zoom viewport view invalidations] --> Cues
    Reports[CONTACT report coordinates and confidence only] --> Abstract
    Exit[Remove or replace world] --> Disconnect[Disconnect old bindings / release references before free]
    Disconnect --> Field
    Deferred[Solid vehicle contact deferred / no physics authority change] -.-> Field
